    "field": "Aviation climatology",
    "problem": "Verifying the long-debated climatic impact of jet contrails has been difficult because the constant presence of air traffic makes it nearly impossible to isolate their specific effect from other atmospheric variables.",
    "method": "To isolate the climatic effect of jet contrails, we analyzed the daily temperature range during the three-day grounding of US aircraft after September 11, 2001, comparing it to the 30-year average and to the periods immediately before and after the grounding.",
    "task": "The task is to determine the climatic effect of jet contrails by analyzing the change in daily temperature range across the United States during the three-day grounding of commercial aircraft following the September 11, 2001 attacks.",
